    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Scrambler</i>, where adorable characters and menacing enemies collide in a whirlwind of action! In this rogue-like wave survival game, you\u2019ll control a group of lovable yet fierce cartoon heroes, each with unique abilities and powers. Your mission? Survive endless waves of quirky, unpredictable enemies\u2014ranging from mischievous little critters to giant, menacing bosses\u2014all while unlocking new upgrades and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a fresh adventure, with procedurally generated levels ensuring no two experiences are the same. Collect power-ups, discover hidden treasures, and fight to stay alive as the chaos intensifies! With every wave, the challenge grows, but so do your characters, leveling up in delightful and unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrambler combines charming visuals with frantic gameplay. Will you be able to outlast the adorable onslaught and become the ultimate wave survivor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to fight, dodge, and level up in this action-packed rogue-like survival adventure that\u2019s as cute as it is chaotic!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Scrambler</i>, where adorable characters and menacing enemies collide in a whirlwind of action! In this rogue-like wave survival game, you\u2019ll control a group of lovable yet fierce cartoon heroes, each with unique abilities and powers. Your mission? Survive endless waves of quirky, unpredictable enemies\u2014ranging from mischievous little critters to giant, menacing bosses\u2014all while unlocking new upgrades and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a fresh adventure, with procedurally generated levels ensuring no two experiences are the same. Collect power-ups, discover hidden treasures, and fight to stay alive as the chaos intensifies! With every wave, the challenge grows, but so do your characters, leveling up in delightful and unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrambler combines charming visuals with frantic gameplay. Will you be able to outlast the adorable onslaught and become the ultimate wave survivor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to fight, dodge, and level up in this action-packed rogue-like survival adventure that\u2019s as cute as it is chaotic!</p>",
    "short_description": "Scrambler is a fast-paced rogue-like wave survival game where you control adorable cartoon characters fighting off endless waves of quirky enemies. Level up, collect power-ups, and survive as the challenge intensifies in procedurally generated levels.",
